                                                "sense_id": "3f8a0755-c889-38e3-b93c-12ee1744057e",
                                                "text": "Caffeine is a xanthine alkaloid compound that acts as a stimulant in humans. Caffeine is sometimes called guaranine when found in guarana, mateine when found in mate, and theine when found in tea."
